  "_comment": "Curated catalogue seed, hydrated name-by-name via search.php?i={name}. TheCocktailDB's free key caps bulk list endpoints at 100 rows and cuts off alphabetically at 'Kiwi', so no bulk endpoint can see Rum, Tequila or Whisky; per-name lookup is uncapped. Names are upstream's own canonical strIngredient, one per record - 'Kirsch' and 'Kirschwasser' resolve to the same record, so only one is listed. 145 verified entries; 61 have no strDescription upstream and show the no-story state. Ordered with the 84 storied entries first, then the 61 without, each alphabetical: the catalogue loads a page at a time as it scrolls, so ordering has to live here - sorting each page on arrival would restart 'stories first' on every page.",
